## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:**set_and_receive_reminders**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION reminders()
    IF method == POST
        reminder_text = retrieve reminder text from request
        date_time = retrieve date time from request

        call set_reminder(user's session username, reminder_text, date_time)
    ENDIF

    reminders = call get_reminders(user's session username)
    RENDER 'reminders.html' WITH reminders
END FUNCTION

CLASS ReminderManager
    FUNCTION set_reminder(username, reminder_text, date_time)
        append (username, reminder_text, date_time) to reminders list
        open 'reminders.txt' in append mode
            write "username|reminder_text|date_time" to file
        close file
    END FUNCTION

    FUNCTION get_reminders(username)
        CREATE list to hold user's reminders
        FOR each reminder in reminders
            IF reminder.username == username
                append reminder to user's reminders list
            ENDIF
        ENDFOR
        RETURN user's reminders list
    END FUNCTION

END CLASS
```
|Case|:**user_login**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION do_login()
    username = retrieve username from request
    password = retrieve password from request

    IF call login(username, password)
        set user's session with username
        redirect to 'dashboard'
    ELSE
        redirect to 'login'
    ENDIF
END FUNCTION

CLASS UserManager
    FUNCTION login(username, password)
        FOR each user in users
            IF user.username == username AND user.password == password
                RETURN True
            ENDIF
        ENDFOR
        RETURN False
    END FUNCTION
END CLASS
```


